_olex2_refinement_description
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups, All N(H) groups, All N(H,H) groups
2. Restrained distances
 C1AA-C5 = C5-C0AA
 1.38 with sigma of 0.001
3. Restrained planarity
 N1AA, C2, C1AA, C5, C0AA, C3AA
 with sigma of 0.1
4. Rigid bond restraints
 C2, C1AA, C5, C0AA, C3AA
 with sigma for 1-2 distances of 0.02 and sigma for 1-3 distances of 0.01
5. Uiso/Uaniso restraints and constraints
C2 \\sim C5: within 2A with sigma of 0.04 and sigma for terminal atoms of 0.08
Uanis(C2) \\sim Ueq, Uanis(C1AA) \\sim Ueq, Uanis(C5) \\sim Ueq: with sigma of
0.001 and sigma for terminal atoms of 0.002
Uanis(N3) \\sim Ueq, Uanis(N1AA) \\sim Ueq: with sigma of 0.01 and sigma for
terminal atoms of 0.02
Uanis(C2AA) \\sim Ueq: with sigma of 0.01 and sigma for terminal atoms of 0.02
6.a Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 N008(H008), C00A(H00A), C1(H1), C0AA(H0AA), C2AA(H2AA), N1AA(H1AA),
 C3AA(H3AA), C5(H5), C4AA(H4AA), C1AA(H1AB)
6.b X=CH2 refined with riding coordinates:
 N006(H00B,H00C), N007(H00D,H00E)
